# BFF — Lead Form (M20-S01): read-only config here (GET, manager JWT)
# UC-037: Manager configures the lead form module — config WRITES moved to PATCH
#   /v1/tenants/hotsite as of M20-S08; see hotsite-admin.http's own "Lead form config" block.
# UC-041 (Trigger): status endpoint powers the dashboard's gated "Leads" nav item
# UC-041 (M20-S06): admin submissions read — paginated list + read-only detail
# UC-041 (M20-S12): search/filters/date range on the list, plus filter-options for the
#   advanced-filter dropdown
# status and submissions are available to staff and managers.
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run seed
#   4. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev  (port 3001)
#   5. pnpm --filter @ikaro/bff run dev      (port 3002)
#   6. ENABLE_DEV_AUTH=true in apps/bff/.env.local
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in VS Code status bar

@managerToken = {{managerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
@staffToken   = {{staffLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

###
# @name managerLogin
POST {{bffUrl}}/v1/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@lavacar.com.br", "tenantSlug": "{{tenantSlug}}", "type": "staff" }

###
# @name staffLogin
POST {{bffUrl}}/v1/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "funcionario@lavacar.com.br", "tenantSlug": "{{tenantSlug}}", "type": "staff" }

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HAPPY PATH
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Manager gets current lead form config (default shape for a tenant with no row yet)
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/tenants/lead-form/config
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

###

### Staff reads the nav-gating status
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/tenants/lead-form/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### Staff lists submissions — paginated, ordered submittedAt DESC
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/tenants/lead-form/submissions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### Staff lists submissions — basic search (M20-S12, min 3 chars)
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/tenants/lead-form/submissions?page=1&pageSize=20&search=casado
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### Staff lists submissions — advanced filters, ANDed (M20-S12, JSON-encoded array, max 5 entries)
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/tenants/lead-form/submissions?page=1&pageSize=20&filters=%5B%7B%22questionLabel%22%3A%22Estado%20civil%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22casado%22%7D%5D
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### Staff lists submissions — date range, orthogonal to search/filters (M20-S12)
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/tenants/lead-form/submissions?page=1&pageSize=20&submittedFrom=2026-01-01&submittedTo=2026-01-31
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### Staff reads filter-options — distinct question labels for the advanced-filter dropdown (M20-S12)
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/tenants/lead-form/submissions/filter-options
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### Staff reads submission detail — full answers snapshot
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/tenants/lead-form/submissions/01234567-0000-7000-8000-000000000201
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FAILURE PATHS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### search under 3 chars → 400 GENERIC_VALUE_TOO_SHORT (M20-S12)
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/tenants/lead-form/submissions?search=ab
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### search and filters both present → 400 GENERIC_VALUE_INVALID (M20-S12)
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/tenants/lead-form/submissions?search=casado&filters=%5B%7B%22questionLabel%22%3A%22Estado%20civil%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22casado%22%7D%5D
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### submittedFrom after submittedTo → 400 GENERIC_VALUE_OUT_OF_RANGE (M20-S12)
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/tenants/lead-form/submissions?submittedFrom=2026-02-01&submittedTo=2026-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### Submission detail for an unknown id → 404 PLATFORM_LEAD_FORM_SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/tenants/lead-form/submissions/01234567-0000-7000-8000-000000000999
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
